   What are you going to do?
 For our site in Raamsdonksveer, we are looking for reinforcement. Can you get the best out of the production lines in a small production environment with an eye on safety, quality and output? Then we are looking for you!
Responsibilities:
- You have technical insight so that you can quickly anticipate malfunctions on your machine or in the process;
- You take care of the preparation/preparation/packing and filling process;
- You check product quality and make adjustments where necessary at all stages of the production process;
- You also ensure that production orders are completed and adjusted correctly;
- Order and cleanliness of the machines and workplace is a habit of yours.

This is what you get!
 - A full-time job in day shift;
- Salary between 16,50 and 17,50 per hour; 
- A challenging position in a fun and dynamic team;
- An attractive salary package with good fringe benefits.

This represents you!
 - Being able to register follow-up data of the activities;
- You can identify deviations;
- Experience as an operator is not required but a plus;
- You speak and understand English or Dutch fluently;
- You are a good team player but can also work very accurately independently;
- You can keep rules and agreements;
- You are inquisitive and flexible;
- You are in possession of a forklift certificate. 

This is your future workplace:
 You will join a global leader in food and feed additives.
